    "revalidation": {
      "title": "Sea service for revalidation",
      "info": {
        "title": "About Revalidation Calculation",
        "description": "Sea service for revalidation is calculated according to STCW Convention requirements (Manila Amendments). According to STCW Convention Chapter I, Regulation I/1, paragraph 22: \"Month means a calendar month, or 30 days in periods of less than a month.\" This calculation helps you track the minimum sea time needed to revalidate your certificates of competency.",
        "method": "Calculation Method (STCW Convention):",
        "methodDescription": "Step 1: Calculate full calendar months for each contract. A full month is counted from date to date (e.g., Jan 15 to Feb 14 = 1 month). Step 2: Accumulate remaining days from all contracts. Step 3: Convert accumulated days to months (30 days = 1 month). Example: 32 accumulated days = 1 month 2 days.",
        "example": "Example:",
        "exampleDescription": "Contract 1: Jan 15 - Feb 20 = 1 month (Jan 15→Feb 14) + 6 days. Contract 2: Mar 10 - Apr 15 = 1 month (Mar 10→Apr 9) + 6 days. Total: 2 months + (6+6=12 days) = 2 months 12 days.",
        "note": "Important Note:",
        "noteDescription": "Different certificates may have different revalidation requirements (e.g., 12 months in the last 5 years, or 3 months in the last 5 years). Always verify specific requirements with your flag administration. The calculation strictly follows STCW Convention Regulation I/1.22."
      },
      "infoTitle": "Sea Service Calculation",
      "infoText": "Sea service for revalidation is calculated according to STCW Convention (Manila Amendments), Regulation I/1, paragraph 22:\n\n\"Month means a calendar month, or 30 days in periods of less than a month.\"\n\nCalculation method:\n1. Full calendar months are counted for each contract (e.g. Jan 15 to Feb 14 = 1 month).\n2. Remaining days from all contracts are summed.\n3. Accumulated days are converted to months (30 days = 1 month).\n\nExample:\nContract 1: Jan 15 - Feb 20 = 1 month + 6 days\nContract 2: Mar 10 - Apr 15 = 1 month + 6 days\nTotal: 2 months + 12 days\n\nRecords without Sign Off date are excluded. Use the toggle on each card to include or exclude a voyage."
    }
  },
